{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42385","headline":"蒙恩赐酒旨令醉进诗以谢 · 徐铉","name":"蒙恩赐酒旨令醉进诗以谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明光殿里夜迢迢，多病逢秋自寂寥。\n蜡炬乍传丹凤诏，御题初认白云谣。\n今宵幸识衢尊味，明日知停入合朝。\n爲感君恩判一醉，不烦辛苦解金貂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42385.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42385","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}